{"unit_id":"little-traincar__dsh-comm#card-zh","repo":"little-traincar/dsh-comm","commit":"02dbb84c6ea530cd4d902201c07d8f4888a666e4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-comm 是面向 DSH Web 与 Desktop 客户端的通信调试插件，在右侧边栏提供串口、TCP 服务端与客户端、UDP 调试面板，并通过 DSH 工具让模型读取链路状态和收发数据。它支持文本与 HEX 编解码、常见字符编码、发送后等待匹配回应、TCP 客户端查看、串口参数调整以及 Host 侧周期和序列发送。日志可搜索、暂停、录制或导出，并有容量上限与丢弃计数；自动回复可按规则执行，也可转交 DSH 会话。适合需要从 DSH 操作设备串口或网络协议的开发调试场景。使用需 Node.js 22.19 或更高版本；串口能力限 Windows，网络链路也可使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:170-198","lib/index.js:2219-2416","lib/serial-windows.js:23-24"]}
{"unit_id":"little-traincar__dsh-comm#card-en","repo":"little-traincar/dsh-comm","commit":"02dbb84c6ea530cd4d902201c07d8f4888a666e4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-comm adds a DSH sidebar for serial, TCP, and UDP debugging. Tools inspect links and exchange text or HEX, wait for responses, control serial lines, and run timed sends. Bounded logs can be searched, paused, recorded, and exported. Requires Node.js 22.19+; serial is Windows-only.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:170-198","lib/index.js:2219-2416","lib/serial-windows.js:23-24"]}
